1
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Upwards on the horizon rises the Eastern Sun,

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,999
the light in the eyes of the believers in justice.

3
00:00:18,999 --> 00:00:23,800
Bahman is the zenith of our faith.

4
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:28,000
Your message, O Imam of independence and freedom

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:34,000
is imprinted on our souls!

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,000
O Martyrs,

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:41,000
your clamors echo in the ears of time!

8
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Enduring, continuing, and eternal:

9
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:57,000
The Islamic Republic of Iran